{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "t2_a",
  "tier": 2,
  "name": "Operations Network A",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 2: mixed solo/paired ambient patrols, carts, MFA doors, hardened gates, and a second zero-day in the hub ($).",
    "Three long horizontal lanes. Route A has a conveyor (A2), a loop, an MFA/keypad/hardened gate (A3) and a service/paired hazard (A4).",
    "Route B has a cart ride (B2), an MFA/hardened gate (B3) and a service/paired hazard (B4). Route C has a conveyor (C2), a gate (C3) and a hazard (C4).",
    "A3, B3 and C3 accept the carried T1_MAINT permission as an optional shortcut. Service robots grant T2_OPS, which carries into tier 3.",
    "Exit trigger is cell [49,11]; one fixed camera in the exit room at [50,9]."
  ],
